From 1a1d764d2cc5f5a3d824ca2d1bc5e129d8adf368 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gus bourg <gus@bourg.net>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 20:18:27 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 16/17] media: amlogic: amvdec: add a job watchdog and event
 recorder

Record decoder events and report outstanding jobs that exceed the
configured timeout. Cancel watch work during completion and teardown
so diagnostic reports identify active jobs.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-fable-5-1
Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-5.6
Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-6.0
---
